This directory stands where the process `kernel-vio` expects its journal FILE.
Seeding the broken path per-pid (not the whole journal directory) is deliberate:
one `home/` seed serves every leg of the fixture, so breaking the directory
itself would deny the benign legs too and the gate could never prove it allows.
The append raises IsADirectoryError here, an OSError, which is the one and only
condition g__pretool__kernel.py turns into a deny.
